  "text": "A school canteen supervisor notices that a member of staff used the same chopping board to cut raw beef mince and then to slice bread rolls for serving. The bread rolls were eaten without further heating.\n\nAnalyse the food safety risks in this scenario. In your answer, refer to the bacteria involved, the conditions that may have allowed them to reach dangerous levels, and the potential consequences.",
